WEBVTT

00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:18.440
Beneath the roots and fallen leaves

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:24.834
Beyond the world our eyes can see

00:00:25.134 --> 00:00:30.489
A silent web has always grown

00:00:30.789 --> 00:00:36.144
A hidden life beneath our own

00:00:36.444 --> 00:00:43.092
No voice, no words, no beating heart

00:00:43.392 --> 00:00:49.116
Yet every thread becomes a part

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:55.880
Of something ancient, vast and deep

00:00:56.180 --> 00:01:02.089
Awake below while we still sleep

00:01:02.389 --> 00:01:07.744
For centuries we walked above

00:01:08.044 --> 00:01:13.030
Unaware of what connects us

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:17.023
Listen to the forest

00:01:17.323 --> 00:01:21.016
Listen to the ground

00:01:21.316 --> 00:01:25.933
The oldest living network

00:01:26.233 --> 00:01:30.295
Has always been around

00:01:30.595 --> 00:01:35.212
A million unseen pathways

00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:39.574
A language yet unknown

00:01:39.874 --> 00:01:43.568
We are only learning

00:01:43.868 --> 00:01:47.561
How to hear its tone

00:01:47.861 --> 00:01:55.247
Through storm and fire, drought and rain

00:01:55.547 --> 00:02:02.195
The network learns, adapts, sustains

00:02:02.495 --> 00:02:09.512
It feeds the weak, it shares the light

00:02:09.812 --> 00:02:15.906
It keeps the balance out of sight

00:02:16.206 --> 00:02:21.746
No king, no center, no command

00:02:22.046 --> 00:02:29.247
Yet forests rise from thread and strand

00:02:29.547 --> 00:02:34.903
A living map beneath our feet

00:02:35.203 --> 00:02:42.220
Where countless lives and signals meet

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:45.105
Not to conquer

00:02:45.405 --> 00:02:47.252
Not to own

00:02:47.552 --> 00:02:50.691
But to understand

00:02:50.991 --> 00:02:54.684
Listen to the forest

00:02:54.984 --> 00:02:58.677
Listen to the ground

00:02:58.977 --> 00:03:03.594
The oldest living network

00:03:03.894 --> 00:03:07.956
Has always been around

00:03:08.256 --> 00:03:12.873
A million unseen pathways

00:03:13.173 --> 00:03:17.235
A language yet unknown

00:03:17.535 --> 00:03:21.229
We are only learning

00:03:21.529 --> 00:03:25.222
How to hear its tone

00:03:25.522 --> 00:03:30.323
Science lights the pathway

00:03:30.623 --> 00:03:34.870
Wonder starts the flame

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:39.787
Questions lead us forward

00:03:40.087 --> 00:03:44.334
Before we know the name

00:03:44.634 --> 00:03:48.327
Every signal matters

00:03:48.627 --> 00:03:52.320
Every voice may grow

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:58.529
The future starts with listening

00:03:58.829 --> 00:04:02.892
To what we do not know

00:04:03.192 --> 00:04:06.885
Listen to the forest

00:04:07.185 --> 00:04:10.694
Listen to the trees

00:04:10.994 --> 00:04:15.795
Listen to the hidden world

00:04:16.095 --> 00:04:20.527
Beneath the roots we see

00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:25.443
A million unseen pathways

00:04:25.743 --> 00:04:29.437
Connected all as one

00:04:29.737 --> 00:04:33.799
And we have just begun

00:04:34.099 --> 00:04:37.423
We have just begun

00:04:37.723 --> 00:04:40.678
Beneath our feet

00:04:40.978 --> 00:04:44.117
The network waits

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:48.479
And we have just begun

00:04:48.779 --> 00:04:50.441
To listen
